<title>USA: Affiliated Computer gets outsource pact.</title>
<headline>Affiliated Computer gets outsource pact.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Affiliated Computer Services Inc said on Wednesday it has signed a seven-year, $20 million agreement with Piedmont Natural Gas Co Inc to provide mainframe computer operations, job scheduling and system software support for Piedmont.</p>
<p>Affiliated said Piedmont will save more than $5 million in operating costs over the seven year period.</p>
</text>
